    <p style="margin:0 0 18px; color:#333333; font-size:15px; line-height:1.6;">Dear colleague,</p>

    <p style="margin:0 0 18px; color:#333333; font-size:15px; line-height:1.6;">There are now <strong>six weeks left</strong> to submit a nomination for the 22nd International Electoral Awards, which we will present in Manila this December with our co-hosts, the Commission on Elections of the Philippines (COMELEC). Nominations close on <strong>Monday, 31 August 2026</strong>.</p>

    <p style="margin:0 0 24px; color:#333333; font-size:15px; line-height:1.6;">The Awards recognise the electoral management bodies, officials, civil society organisations and international institutions whose work has strengthened elections around the world. If your organisation, or a colleague elsewhere in the electoral community, has delivered work that deserves recognition, we would encourage you to put a nomination forward. Submitting takes only a short online form.</p>

    <!-- Key details box -->
    <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin: 0 0 28px; background-color:#f0f4f8; border-radius:6px; border-left:4px solid #1a2744;">
    <tr><td style="padding: 20px 24px;">
        <p style="margin:0 0 12px; color:#1a2744; font-size:16px; font-weight:700;">Key Details</p>
        <table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
            <tr>
                <td style="padding:4px 16px 4px 0; color:#666; font-size:14px; vertical-align:top; white-space:nowrap;"><strong>Deadline:</strong></td>
                <td style="padding:4px 0; color:#333; font-size:14px;">Monday, 31 August 2026</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td style="padding:4px 16px 4px 0; color:#666; font-size:14px; vertical-align:top; white-space:nowrap;"><strong>Winners announced:</strong></td>
                <td style="padding:4px 0; color:#333; font-size:14px;">Awards Ceremony, Tuesday, 1 December 2026, The Manila Hotel</td>
            </tr>
