    <p style="margin:0 0 28px; color:#555; font-size:14px; line-height:1.6;">The Awards Committee also confers the Lifetime Achievement Award, Electoral Commissioner of the Year and Electoral Commission of the Year. Full criteria for every category are on our website: <a href="https://www.electoralnetwork.org/awards/categories" style="color:#1a2744;">electoralnetwork.org/awards/categories</a>.</p>

