    <p style="margin:0 0 18px; color:#333333; font-size:15px; line-height:1.6;">Thank you to everyone who joined our <strong>Speed in Election Results Transmission</strong> webinar on 14 July, and to our speakers Rui Santos (Plus 351) and Eduardo Repilloza Fern&aacute;ndez (Transparencia Electoral) for a practical discussion of how EMBs can deliver results quickly without compromising accuracy or trust. If you missed it and would like the recording, reply to this email and we will send it across.</p>

    <p style="margin:0 0 24px; color:#333333; font-size:15px; line-height:1.6;">Not yet registered for Manila? Attendance is free and accommodation at The Manila Hotel is covered. You can <a href="https://www.electoralnetwork.org/events/69938de4f4f23e0fef2e3129" style="color:#1a2744;">register here</a>.</p>

    <p style="margin:0 0 18px; color:#333333; font-size:15px; line-height:1.6; text-align:center;">
